Z||000011||Jimmy||06-04-2001||10:25 AM||||Yeah the go-karts were a lot of fun!  Lisa I think I remember kicking your butt on the second race.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">  Northstar87 should not be allowed to drive karts, he is a maniac.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> LOL<P>Anyway, Thanks Jaei Sun and Mike for all the help, and to anybody else who borrowed me tools!  I was able to get home(220 miles) without use of the clutch.  Never grinded a gear.  Drove it right up to my garage.<P>Jim<BR>87 GT t-top v8<BR>87 GT<P>BTW Jaei Sun I think I did about 30 circles at the rest stop while the girls took a quick break.  lol   ||||reg||1
Z||000012||FieroLisa||06-04-2001||10:26 AM||||Oh I'll be go karting next year, don't you worry... and I'll make sure to perfect my skills before then  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> That way, no one can slam me up into the curb again (oww my shoulder still hurts!)<P>Ummm I have 30 Dells pics up on my website, go look!!!! <BR> <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/showpics.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/showpics.html</A>  <P> Just scroll down and click on the Dells link. Also have Pics from 11 other Fiero shows in the past year.<P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 violet pearl 4 speed GT: 17 in. rims, lowered, cold-air intake<BR>AOL IM: FieroLisa<P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A>*<A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>NC Tarheels Fieros Site</A>||||reg||1
Z||000013||87 Pegasus||06-04-2001||11:45 AM||||Hey Lisa....I spoke to the guy who did the paint job on that one purple fiero.  It's not metal flaked.  That is actually crushed christmas tree lights.  It cost him a pretty penny to do that.||||reg||11
Z||000014||northstar87||06-04-2001||11:57 AM||||Hey Jimmy,<BR>   I can't believe they let me get into one of the carts!  I had a great time.  I am glad you made it home ok.  Next time I see you I will give you a ride in the Convertible.  As for Lisa, sorry I had to beat you everytime.  My go-karting skills were just too great for you!  HA!  Thanks again for everyone that helped and put on the show.  <P>Chris Moore<BR>86 GT Convertible Northstar<BR>87 GT Northstar<BR>88 GT T-TOP 3.4 5 speed<BR>88 GT T-TOP stock||||reg||1
