Z||000016||Jaei Sun||06-04-2001||12:58 PM||||Jim you got mail!,<P>I got the pictures on line and in thumbnail format... I didn't want to reduce the size/quality of the pictures. See them here:<BR> <A HREF="http://jaeisfieropix.50megs.com/Page.html" TARGET=_blank>http://jaeisfieropix.50megs.com/Page.html</A> <P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://home.mn.rr.com/fierojaei/trans_fiero_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||4
Z||000017||Jimmy||06-04-2001||08:03 PM||||    Nice pics Jaei Sun!  Chris I think Lisa is a little sore that you knocked her around on that last track.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I know KEV took a big hit when he got turned around, I think we scared a lot of people on that last one.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <P>    I have my Fiero clutch line fixed, all is well when you can buy something as simple a s a new brake line(nothing open within 150 miles of the dells).  Can't wait to meet up with all of you next year. <BR>   <BR>    Chris let me know/send me info on the next show you were talking about.  I'll have to take you up on that offer for a ride, however, I think its going to be tough getting that certain someone out of your passenger seat!<P>Jim<BR>||||reg||1
