Z||000019||fierohoho||06-04-2001||10:46 PM||||All I have to say on the go-karts is, it was nice to be passed by: Lisa, Annette, Fred, Chris, Jim, Ect...Ect...Oh and KEV thanks for all the pushes.<P>Lisa good luck on the finals nice to meet you. Congrats on the trophy, nice car, you do good work. <BR>Jim, glad you made it home OK.<BR>Fred and Annette, thanks for the company (goes to everyone really) had a blast, you have mail.<BR>Jaei Sun, great to meet you, hope to see you at the club meetings, nice pics (you too Lisa).<BR>OK sorry..... bla,bla,bla, Me and my wife had fun, Later, Steve & Dianne||||reg||1
Z||000020||RAREW66||06-05-2001||12:46 AM||||I need to mention the fact that I ate Fiero Lisa's @ss for two whole laps. Thanks Chris and Erik for the Dale Earnhardt re-enactment on the track. I am still sore.<P>Great time at the Dell's as usual!! My 248k Formula brought home a trophy, as die Annette's 87 GT. And Heartland Fiero's received the traveling trophy for Club Participation.<P>Fred<BR>||||reg||12
